{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00077",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.18,
      "end_seconds": 4.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.57,
      "end_seconds": 10.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.2,
      "end_seconds": 15.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Well, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.08,
      "end_seconds": 20.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.91,
      "end_seconds": 25.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Um, so... a missed period. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.0,
      "end_seconds": 31.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Alright, and when did that start? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.4,
      "end_seconds": 35.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "It's been going on for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.39,
      "end_seconds": 39.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Have you been needing to pass urine more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.44,
      "end_seconds": 44.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Yes, since last weekend. There's tender breasts as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.11,
      "end_seconds": 59.76,
      "duration_seconds": 14.65,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.1,
      "end_seconds": 64.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.93,
      "end_seconds": 70.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any dizziness, severe abdominal pain or vomiting everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.0,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.41,
      "end_seconds": 78.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any burning when passing urine, fever or bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.88,
      "end_seconds": 84.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I haven't had burning when passing urine, fever or bleeding, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.82,
      "end_seconds": 90.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.52,
      "end_seconds": 93.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.39,
      "end_seconds": 97.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.59,
      "end_seconds": 100.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.95,
      "end_seconds": 105.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.49,
      "end_seconds": 122.08,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 123.17,
      "end_seconds": 128.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Heart rate 65, temperature 36.6, blood pressure 122 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.2,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.15,
      "end_seconds": 134.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.54,
      "end_seconds": 136.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.38,
      "end_seconds": 153.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.42,
      "end_seconds": 169.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I did try to ignore it for a while. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. Seretide inhaler, twice a day. It's folic acid, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 173.62,
      "end_seconds": 177.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 2.5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.34,
      "end_seconds": 181.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.25,
      "end_seconds": 189.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. I used to take Asthalin inhaler, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.51,
      "end_seconds": 206.63,
      "duration_seconds": 16.12,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.71,
      "end_seconds": 209.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.1,
      "end_seconds": 215.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.08,
      "end_seconds": 218.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.63,
      "end_seconds": 220.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.33,
      "end_seconds": 227.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Right, I've had asthma, yes. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.97,
      "end_seconds": 230.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.42,
      "end_seconds": 242.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known an underactive thyroid. We'll keep that in mind today. Yes, I can see the heart disease in your file as well. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.52,
      "end_seconds": 247.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "So, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.28,
      "end_seconds": 250.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.83,
      "end_seconds": 254.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.69,
      "end_seconds": 258.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.61,
      "end_seconds": 260.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.37,
      "end_seconds": 270.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.59,
      "end_seconds": 273.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.26,
      "end_seconds": 281.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Just to be sure I've got this right, the Thyronorm, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.08,
      "end_seconds": 283.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "It's 50 micrograms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.67,
      "end_seconds": 289.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.12,
      "end_seconds": 292.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.81,
      "end_seconds": 313.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Tummy is soft, non-tender, and the uterus isn't palpable above the pelvic bone yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.84,
      "end_seconds": 341.29,
      "duration_seconds": 22.45,
      "text": "Right, that's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.88,
      "end_seconds": 344.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.46,
      "end_seconds": 367.07,
      "duration_seconds": 21.61,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like an early pregnancy. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out a late period for another reason yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a missed period for six months, and no bleeding or severe abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.42,
      "end_seconds": 369.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.24,
      "end_seconds": 373.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.48,
      "end_seconds": 389.8,
      "duration_seconds": 15.32,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.66,
      "end_seconds": 398.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for antenatal screening. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.11,
      "end_seconds": 401.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.92,
      "end_seconds": 408.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "We should do a pregnancy test for missed period. Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.09,
      "end_seconds": 416.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "I did have an early scan done a few months ago, but the paper's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.25,
      "end_seconds": 441.7,
      "duration_seconds": 24.45,
      "text": "Small, frequent meals and dry crackers before getting out of bed can calm the morning nausea. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 442.71,
      "end_seconds": 444.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 445.2,
      "end_seconds": 453.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you have bleeding or sharp pain on one side. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 454.9,
      "end_seconds": 456.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.7,
      "end_seconds": 461.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.54,
      "end_seconds": 463.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 464.56,
      "end_seconds": 470.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 472.15,
      "end_seconds": 476.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 477.18,
      "end_seconds": 481.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 482.16,
      "end_seconds": 484.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}